OWNERSHIP: the lead owns the hubs (trees/*.tree), trees/log/log-2026-11.tree,
trees/log/release-unreleased.tree, trees/policy, trees/people, trees/session, AGENTS.md, the flake.
Do not edit those: the lead adds your trees to designs.tree and to the two changelog lists from
your index file. JW1: trees/design + trees/decision. JW2: trees/insight + trees/example +
trees/problem. JW3: trees/log (entries log-XXXX only).

INDEX: append one line per finished tree to journal/.index-<JW1|JW2|JW3>.tsv:
  address<TAB>kind<TAB>title<TAB>source document
Changelog entries use the same four columns; the lead reads the date and the area tag from the
tree itself.
When you are done, create journal/.done-<JW1|JW2|JW3>.
